                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I came here to collect my Asia Miles card.\n\nIt\u0027s about a 7-minute walk from the MRT station, which is a bit inconvenient.\n\nThe store is small but very clean, and the color scheme is quite unique.\n\nThe staff were very unfriendly; they really need to work on that. Even through their masks, you could tell how much they didn\u0027t want to go to work.\n\nThe food came out at a moderate pace. The floating iced coffee and waffles were very ordinary, nothing special. I couldn\u0027t see what made them so delicious, as other reviews claimed.\n\nI won\u0027t be coming back.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "為了集亞洲萬里通而來\n\n出捷運站後大概要走個7分鐘\n有點不方便\n\n門市小小的但很乾淨\n配色也很特別\n\n服務人員態度很不親切\n會覺得要好好調整一下才行\n隔著口罩都能感受到有多不想上班\n\n餐點出餐速度適中\n漂浮冰咖啡跟鬆餅都很普通\n沒有什麼特別的特色\n我吃不出來其他評論說的好吃在哪裡\n\n不會再回來",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
